<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warants on Telefonica de Espana.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warants on Telefonica de Espana.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co said it has issued two million American-style call warrants on Telefonica de Espana S.A.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2255 PTE		  PREMIUM	8.46 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     321 PTE		   GEARING	7.39 X</p>
<p> EXEPIRATION     12.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2375 PTE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
